[155.548473, "i", "git commit -m \"security: fix deploy.key permissions and add security documentation\n\n- Changed secrets/deploy.key from 0644 to 0600 (owner-only access)\n- Added SECURITY.md documenting hook protections and best practices\n- Enhanced pre-commit hook with warnings about --no-verify\n- Added pre-push hook to catch bypassed pre-commit checks\n- Added pre-receive hook for server-side enforcement\n- Set hooks.allowNoVerify=false in git config\n\nThis addresses the security issue where commit c149e80 bypassed\npre-commit hook (likely via --no-verify flag) and committed a\nworld-readable private key.\"\n"]
