[220.039403, "o", "grep -E '\\.(pem|key)$' | grep -v '^100600\\|^100400'\r\n   done\r\n   ```\r\n\r\n## "]
[220.039437, "o", "Lessons Learned\r\n\r\n1. **Defense in Depth**: Single-layer protection (pre-commit only) is insufficient\r\n2. **Clie"]
[220.039473, "o", "nt-side hooks are advisory**: They can be bypassed; need server-side enforcement\r\n3. **Automation needs constraint"]
[220.039506, "o", "s**: CI/CD systems should respect security hooks\r\n4. **Documentation matters**: Clear guidance pr"]
